sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor L as Learner
participant B as Browser SPA
participant A as FastAPI /sessions
participant C as SQL classifier
participant E as SQL executor
participant D as Dataset schema
L->>B: SQL in editor
B->>A: POST /sessions/{id}/sql-run
A->>C: AST allowlist (pglast/sqlglot)
C-->>A: allowed or rejected
A->>E: create disposable container
A->>D: provision ds_* schema
A->>E: execute as learner_ro (read-only)
E-->>A: bounded typed rows
A->>D: drop schema
A->>E: remove container / lease
A-->>B: columns, types, rows, limits
Note over A,E: writable demo: BEGIN -> DDL/DML -> ROLLBACK -> drop container. Grading always uses the read-only path.
